> FJH is the duo of Will Brooks and Michael[ Mare], members of Dälek and Destructo[ Swarm]bots respectively. Fill Jackson Heights combines epic effected guitars, layered with impossibly slow beats and hazy improvised production. The experimental duo is just starting on this musical journey to the darker recesses of their minds.
singer has[ begun] a solo career in the[ Philippines], after over a decade of being in family bands: experimental New JerusalemProjekt and dark industrial[ Ven]etia Obscura. Skint Eastwood has since collaborated with Metro Zu (Miami), Tippa Irie (London),KONIDA (Tokyo), Red-I (Manila),[ Circle Traps] (London),[ Con]clave (Manila), and ERAS (LA).
