> The OTR[ 1840] is a CWDM Fiber Optic to SDI[ transmitter] and receiver combined in a[ compact] self[ contained] package. It is a convenient and cost effective solution to combat the[ restrictions] involved with the distribution of[ uncomp]ressed[ broadcast] quality video signals over long distances.
Each OTR[ 1840] CWDM[ trance]iver has an independant[ transmitter] and[ receiver] channel, which provides an effective solution for any SDI signal up to 1080p60 (3Gbit/s) while[ preserving] full[ uncomp]ressed quality.[ Select] from 18[ transmitter] wavelengths for full CWDM compatibility (ITU-T G.[694].2).
The OTR[ 1840] will auto-detect and re-clock any 270Mbit / 1.5Gbit and 3Gbit SDI source prior to conversion. The module is fully compatible with 3Gbit Level A and Level B formats.

